	measure 'Average Delivery Days' = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    AVERAGEX(
			        SUMMARIZE(
			            Orders, 
			            Orders[Order ID], 
			            Orders[Order Date],
			            Orders[Ship Date]
			        ),
			    Orders[Ship Date] - Orders[Order Date]
			    ))
			```
